        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "e61511dd-cb70-5682-8cea-337cc7748b52",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Laws: Adoption and Safe Families Act\n- People: Bill Clinton\n- Organizations: United States Congress\n- Topics: foster care adoption goals\n\nFacts:\n- The Adoption and Safe Families Act of 1997 aimed to lower barriers to adoption and to double adoptions of children in foster care by 2002.\n- The foster care adoption goal increased from 27,000 adoptions in 1996 to 54,000 adoptions in 2002.\n- The United States Congress approved the Adoption and Safe Families Act earlier in November 1997.\n- President Bill Clinton signed the Adoption and Safe Families Act, Public Law 105-89, into law on November 19, 1997.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
        "id": 1,
